'''Mami Cat''' is a [[:Category:Rare Cats|Rare Cat]] that can be obtained by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Puella Magi Madoka Magica Collaboration Event]]. She was added in [[Version 5.5 Update|Version 5.5]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 297
|rarity = RR
|name1 = Mami Cat
|name2 = Magical Girl Mami Cat
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Magical Girl Mami Cat''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
Magical Girl Mami Cat has the same range as [[Mer-Cat (Rare Cat)|Cameraman Cat]] and a relatively fast cooldown, however her low DPS and [[Single Attack]] render her near useless in her niche outside of early-game stages. Even enemies she can perform somewhat well against (e.g. [[Sunfish Jones]]) have better counters in her rarity, such as [[Food Stall Cat (Rare Cat)|Cafeteria Cat]] and [[Ancient Egg: N106 (Rare Cat)|Mushroom Cat]]. This means she is usually only helpful for [[User Rank]] purposes.

{{Job|Classification = User Rank Dump & Melee|EvolvedClass = User Rank Dump & Midranger|TrueClass=|UltraClass=}}

